    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="ch8subch2">

                <pb facs="0177" n="101" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg101"/>

                <head>Suspension of payments on the Austrian relief obligation<anchor n="8"
                        xml:id="ch8subch2-f1"/></head>
                <p>[For announcement summarizing correspondence in 1935 regarding the inability of
                    the Austrian Government to make payment of amounts due the United States, see
                    Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">Press Releases</hi>, January 11,
                    1936, page 23.</p>
                <p>No further payments of amounts due the United States were made and no agreement
                    was reached regarding a moratorium prior to the occupation of Austria by Germany
                    in 1938.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
